      "title": "List PipelineRuns"
    },
    "description": "List a namespace's Tekton PipelineRuns, newest first: status, timing, and for runs started by Pipelines-as-Code the Git event behind them (repository, branch, commit, pull request, sender). Returns names to pass to get_pipelinerun.",
